From: Anvil campaign draft <draft@anvil.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] ANDROID: x86_64: gki_defconfig: enable DMABUF_HEAPS_SYSTEM
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

The AOSP cuttlefish graphics stack cannot boot an android15-6.6 GKI
kernel without /dev/dma_heap/system. Origin gki_defconfig enables the
dma-buf heap framework and two helper libraries (DMABUF_HEAPS=y,
DMABUF_SYSFS_STATS=y, DMABUF_HEAPS_DEFERRED_FREE=y,
DMABUF_HEAPS_PAGE_POOL=y) but not the system heap itself, so the device
node never appears and the cuttlefish gralloc allocator APEX
(android.hardware.graphics.allocator-service.minigbm, com.google.cf.gralloc)
exits at startup. The composer (device/generic/goldfish hwc3
GuestFrameComposer::onDisplayCreate) then dereferences the failed
DrmSwapchain::create() null unconditionally and SIGSEGV-loops;
system_server never finishes and sys.boot_completed is never reached.

Demonstrated on aosp_cf_x86_64_only_phone CP2A.260605.016 (build 16373615)
against android15-6.6 @ c905c29016dd2dbf8df45e7c0287455f67ef165b: two
otherwise bit-identical GKI builds differing in exactly this one resolved
config line (verified by diffing the full resolved .configs): without the
line, TIMEOUT t=1204s with the allocator/composer failure chain above;
with it, sys.boot_completed=1 at t=786s. Android userspace broadly
expects the system heap for CPU-accessible gralloc/codec buffers, and the
Kconfig help text itself reads "If in doubt, say Y."

Enable it for x86_64 GKI. (arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig carries the
same omission; not changed here because the boot demonstration above is
x86_64-only - flagged for follow-up.)

Bug: <tracker id - see ISSUE.md before submitting>
Signed-off-by: <submitter>
---
diff --git a/arch/x86/configs/gki_defconfig b/arch/x86/configs/gki_defconfig
index 53bdf06f9..77d8c05b8 100644
--- a/arch/x86/configs/gki_defconfig
+++ b/arch/x86/configs/gki_defconfig
@@ -540,6 +540,7 @@ CONFIG_RTC_CLASS=y
 CONFIG_RTC_LIB_KUNIT_TEST=m
 CONFIG_UDMABUF=y
 CONFIG_DMABUF_HEAPS=y
+CONFIG_DMABUF_HEAPS_SYSTEM=y
 CONFIG_DMABUF_SYSFS_STATS=y
 CONFIG_DMABUF_HEAPS_DEFERRED_FREE=y
 CONFIG_DMABUF_HEAPS_PAGE_POOL=y

